  "description": "This Pack includes a set of utility formulas that make it easier to work with phone numbers.\n\nIsPhoneNumber() determines if the input is a valid phone number.\nFormatPhoneNumber() rewrites the input phone number into a standard format.\nPhoneNumberInfo() returns various information about the phone number, including the type, country code, region code, etc.\n\nCreated using the awesome-phonenumber NPM module.\nIcon by OpenMoji – the open-source emoji and icon project. License: CC BY-SA 4.0.\nCover photo by James Sutton on Unsplash",
